WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:16.291
Every year on February 14th, couples, friends, and families in many countries give each other cards, chocolate, and

2
00:00:16.351 --> 00:00:22.994
candy. In fact over one billion cards are sent for this day, second only to Christmas.

3
00:00:25.095 --> 00:00:31.967
Children have big parties at school, families send each other cards, and couples might have romantic dinners.

4
00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:34.349
What do you do if you are single?

5
00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:38.392
Well Valentine's Day is not only for couples.

6
00:00:39.252 --> 00:00:40.633
It's about love, remember!

7
00:00:42.354 --> 00:00:44.856
Valentine's Day is your chance to be bold.

8
00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:48.358
Is there a girl or boy that you secretly like?

9
00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:50.760
Why not send them a valentine?

10
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:56.324
A valentine is a card with a message inside, like a poem or love letter.

11
00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.167
You can decide if you want to sign your name or not.

12
00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.932
So where did the idea of Valentine's Day come from?

13
00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:12.739
In Italy about two thousand years ago, February 14th was a day to celebrate love.

14
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:18.605
It was the day that the queen of the Roman gods, Juno, was honored.

15
00:01:19.305 --> 00:01:21.768
Juno was the god of women and marriage.

16
00:01:24.924 --> 00:01:29.547
Young Roman women each wrote their name on a piece of paper and put it in a big

17
00:01:29.607 --> 00:01:32.949
jar. Every young man in the town picked a name.

18
00:01:33.829 --> 00:01:37.391
Then the pairs were partners until the next February.

19
00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:39.633
Sometimes they married.

20
00:01:42.074 --> 00:01:45.796
At one time, however, young lovers in Italy could not marry.

21
00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:47.937
It was against the law!

22
00:01:48.638 --> 00:01:49.598
Why, you may ask?

23
00:01:50.359 --> 00:01:52.540
What could be wrong with people getting married?

24
00:01:54.320 --> 00:02:01.845
Emperor Claudius II, the head of the Roman Empire in 270 AD, needed a big army because he

25
00:02:01.905 --> 00:02:03.006
fought many wars.

26
00:02:04.087 --> 00:02:05.608
He did not have enough soldiers.

27
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:09.410
He believed single men were better soldiers than married men.

28
00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:18.156
If you are married and have a family, you may not want to leave your country and fight

29
00:02:18.236 --> 00:02:19.217
in a distant land.

30
00:02:20.178 --> 00:02:23.600
If you are single, you may like to join the army for an adventure!

31
00:02:27.412 --> 00:02:32.574
Claudius needed more single men to be soldiers, and so he decided to outlaw marriage.

32
00:02:33.535 --> 00:02:36.076
People were angry, but they could do nothing.

33
00:02:36.736 --> 00:02:42.199
Claudius' nickname was Claudius the Cruel, and people who opposed him were usually killed.

34
00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.962
One brave priest, whose name was Valentine, did oppose the emperor.

35
00:02:50.823 --> 00:02:53.864
Father Valentine married couples secretly in his church.

36
00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:58.591
He married many happy couples until one day he was caught.

37
00:02:59.431 --> 00:03:02.453
The Roman guards took him away and threw him in a dungeon.

38
00:03:03.314 --> 00:03:05.335
Emperor Claudius ordered his death.

39
00:03:09.138 --> 00:03:12.940
While Valentine was in jail, he fell in love with the jailer's daughter.

40
00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:18.244
On the last day of his life, he sent her a love letter with the message, From your

41
00:03:18.284 --> 00:03:28.010
Valentine. In 489 AD, Father Valentine was made a saint by the Christian Church, and St.

42
00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.192
Valentine's Day was declared on February 14th.

43
00:03:32.313 --> 00:03:40.737
Father Valentine's message, From your Valentine, is still written in many Valentine's Day cards today, 1,500 years later!

44
00:03:44.039 --> 00:03:51.824
More importantly, Father Valentine's belief in the importance of love is still celebrated today between couples, families, and

45
00:03:51.924 --> 00:03:54.649
friends. Who will you send a valentine to?
